SUMMARY:Let's Go Dancing with a Live Band on Halloween + Pre-dinner (Eglin
 ton Station)
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\nOn **Saturday October 31st\,** **join us f
 or Dancing on Halloween at Function Bar + Kitchen at Eglinton Station.** I
 've been looking for the perfect opportunity to dance and this is it - on 
 Halloween Night! I've booked us a table for dinner prior\, so we will have
  a place to sit during the night. Soul Sublime will be performing live and
  is known to deliver an unending stream of hits and positive energy to the
  dance floor. The Band brings the hottest disco and R&B grooves from the 
 ‘70s to the present day. The ensemble’s catalogue features a curated m
 ix of dance classics from the ‘70s\, ‘80s\, ‘90s\, and present-day\,
  with their high-energy and unique renditions of Earth\, Wind & Fire\, ABB
 A\, CHIC\, Jamiroquai\, Daft Punk\, Beyoncé\, and more. Even though this 
 is not described as a Halloween Party\, folks will be dressing up... and m
 y costume is on its way.\n\n**COST**\nDancing: $10 cover\n\nMeetup Organiz
 er Fee: $5\n\n**SIGNING-UP**\n\n* **RSVP Yes** **with your cell (only I ca
 n see) and confirm if you will be joining for Dinner prior.** We will need
  some people to join for dinner\, so that we can keep our table.\n\nA remi
 nder will be sent the day before with my cell and details where to meet an
 d when.\n\nRSVPs close 3 days prior\, hoping I can still update the reserv
 ation that late. Cancellations will result in a No Show and impact future 
 attendance.\n\n**MEETUP TIME**\n**Meet me at: 8pm inside the front doors o
 f Function Bar + Kitchen at 2291 Yonge St. We will head over to our table 
 together. I will post the location of our table for those joining for the 
 dance only.**\n\n**Dancing: 9:30 - 11:30pm** (people can leave whenever th
 ey wish). For those wishing to stay longer\, another band will start perfo
 rming from 12 midnight- 2am\n\nEnjoy and please post your comments in the 
 Event after.9
