SUMMARY:Canadian Chamber Orchestra Concert at the AGO + Dinner
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\n**Note: This concert is Free with General 
 Admission and seating is limited.**\n\nOn **Friday\, November 13th**\, **j
 oin me for the AGO's Friday Night Series\, with a Special Concert from the
  Canadian Chamber Orchestra.** Throughout the season\, hand-picked CCO mus
 icians will take the stage in smaller ensembles\, blending bold classical 
 masterworks\, contemporary music\, original compositions by our own player
 s\, and fresh\, inventive arrangements of popular favourites. Each perfo
 rmance transforms Walker Court into a vibrant\, living soundscape where ar
 t\, architecture\, and exhilarating live music collide for an unforgettabl
 e concert experience.    Grab a drink or snack from the Espresso Bar
  to enjoy during the performance! Last call is 8:15 pm.\n\nPlease note thi
 s is not a traditional orchestra experience.\n\n**COST**\nAdult: Free with
  General Admission ($30 or Annual Pass $40 for one year)\n\nMeetup Organiz
 er Fee: $5\n\n**SIGNING-UP**\n\n* **RSVP Yes**\n\nA reminder will be sent 
 the day before with my cell and reminder details where to meet and when.\n
 \nRSVPs close 1 day prior\n\n**MEETUP TIME**\n**Meet me at: 5:30pm inside 
 the entrance to the right side of the AGO at 317 Dundas St. W.**\n\n**Conc
 ert: 6 - 9pm**\n\nEnjoy and please post your comments in the Event after.
