SUMMARY:Golden Hour/ Dinner at the No. 1 Chinese Restaurant in Canada (Osg
 oode Station)
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\n**On Saturday\, November 21st\, join us fo
 r Golden Hour/ Dinner at the No. 1 Chinese Restaurant in Canada\, Mott32 i
 n the Shangri-La Hotel.** I have chosen this time so you have a chance to 
 try at "Happy Hour" prices\, as well as the A La Carte Dinner Menu. At the
  17th [annual Chinese Restaurant Awards](https://chineserestaurantawards.c
 om/)\, Mott 32\, located at the Shangri-La Toronto\, was named the No. 1 C
 hinese restaurant in Canada.\nThe restaurant\, which was recognized for it
 s Toronto and Vancouver locations\, took the top spot on the awards’ Eli
 te 30 Canada list\, which celebrates the country’s most outstanding Chin
 ese restaurants\, according to organizers. Please note that the last order
  for Golden Hour is 6:30pm.\n\n**COST**\nOrganizer Meetup fee: $5\nAn etra
 nsfer of $30 ( incl. $5 meetup fee) is required to reserve your spot.\n\n*
 *SIGNING-UP**\n\n* RSVP Yes. Everyone goes on the waitlist until they have
  reserved their seat\, with an etransfer of $30 (includes $5 meetup fee). 
 Attendees will receive back $25 the day after the event.\n* Once you are o
 n the waitlist\, I will message you the email address for the etransfer. P
 lease only send an etransfer if you have signed up.\n* Once the transfer i
 s complete\, I will move you to attending.\n* A reminder will be sent the 
 night before with my cell and all meetup details. Make sure you set up you
 r communication settings to receive.\n\nRSVPs close the Wednesday prior\, 
 hoping I can still accommodate changes. Cancellations will result in a No 
 Show and impact future attendance.\n\n**MEETUP TIME**\n**Meet me at: 6pm i
 nside the front doors of Mott 32 on the ground floor of the Shangri-La Hot
 el at** **190 University Ave**. Please wait for me to arrive\, and do not 
 sit on your own prior\, so we can get the table requested.\n\nLength: 2 ho
 urs\n\nEnjoy and please post your Comments in the event after.
