SUMMARY:La Boheme + Pre-dinner (Queen's Quay Terminal)
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\nOn **Friday November 25th\,** **join us fo
 r La Boheme at The Terminal Theatre in Queen's Quay Terminal.** This will 
 be our first time seeing The Toronto City Opera perform. The group earns s
 trong praise from critics and audiences as an accessible\, high-energy alt
 ernative to Toronto's larger mainstream companies\, with creative stagings
  and strong casts.\nMy seat is Orchestra L8. **Purchase La Boheme on Frida
 y November 27th at 7pm.**\n\nA luminous portrait of young artists chasing 
 love and life in bohemian Paris. When the seamstress Mimì meets the poet 
 Rodolfo\, their romance blossoms amid friendship\, laughter\, and the hars
 h realities of poverty. Inspiring the hit broadway musical *Rent*\, *La bo
 hème* features unforgettable melodies and captures the beauty and fragili
 ty of love.\n\nLanguage: Sung in Italian with projected English translatio
 ns and piano accompaniment.\n\n**COST**\nRegular: $32.50 - $62.50 + fees\n
 \nMeetup fee: $5\n\nTicket Policy: Sales are final and non-refundable.\n\n
 **SIGNING-UP**\n\n* **Simply RSVP Yes\, [purchase](https://ci.ovationtix.c
 om/terminaltheatre/pr/1279910/pe/11827504?deepLink=true) your ticket and p
 ost your seat number and I will move you to attending.**\n* RSVPs close 2 
 days prior\, and cancellations after will result in a No Show and impact f
 uture attendance.\n* A reminder will go out the day before with my cell an
 d details when to meet\, etc.\n\n‐‐----‐----‐‐-------------‐--
 ---------\n**MEETUP TIME**\n**Meet me for dinner: at 5:10pm** **inside the
  front doors of Queen's Harbor Restaurant at 245 Queen's Quay West**\n\n**
 Meet me for the show at: 6:45pm outside the front doors at The Terminal Th
 eatre within Queen's Quay Terminal at 207 Queen's Quay West on the 3rd Flo
 or.**\n\n**Start time: 7pm**\n\nLength: 2 hours 30 mins (incl. 1 intermiss
 ion)\n\nEnjoy and please post your Comments after!
