SUMMARY:30% off The Parfumerie + Pre-Dinner + Post Dessert at The Distille
 ry District
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\n**Note: The sale ends on September 7th at 
 11\;59pm. Theatre tickets allow free and skip-the-line entry into The Dist
 illery District for this show.**\n\n**On Saturday\, November 28th\, see** 
 **The Parfumerie at The Distillery District**. On a snowy night in downtow
 n Budapest\, a perfumery hums with chatter\, gossip\, and the spark of rom
 ance. Behind elegant counters\, clerks scramble through the holiday rush a
 s a secret love ignites.Tender\, sharp\, and riotously funny: *Parfumerie*
  is a romantic comedy about yearning\, connection\, and the leap of faith 
 love demands. My seat is Balcony AA9. **Purchase The Parfumerie on Saturda
 y\, November 28th at 7pm.**\n\n**COST**\nRegular: $115/$135\n\nSale: $73.5
